abstract: >-
  Replication software for Forecasting Liquidity-Stress Recovery with a Guarded
  Cox Correction. The public interface preserves scientific model 4.8.0 and adds
  safe entry points, a stable calibration-intercept reporting correction,
  verification tools and archived numerical reference records.
